#: badend4:badend4_B165DF92_E53D_47AA_BECF_198964743FFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bc0f5f0b1f9615b07dccdf9eb4215fa5ffe96e351727d70f30e0cf399bdd3f0
