msgctxt "badend4:badend4_B165DF92_E53D_47AA_BECF_198964743FFF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sinking into my own darkness."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sto sprofondando nella mia stessa oscurità."

#: badend4:badend4_9E3B30D7_BD5E_48D5_89AA_0E599A990788
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5d08aaf9b0744641567927f7a7b2477d47bc43b27a0ae71e7b21a090f0202b3
#. default-sha256: 64940f0b41057ae70d8009af85ffbba7b4b6c68605a99f036b4e46cc071dd504
msgctxt "badend4:badend4_9E3B30D7_BD5E_48D5_89AA_0E599A990788"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I reach my hand out, but I cannot grasp anything.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Her hand—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫the hand I "
"held for all this time—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫is so far away."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Allungo la mano, ma non riesco ad aggrapparmi a niente.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La sua mano—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫la "
"mano che ho tenuto per tutto questo tempo—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫è così lontana."

#: badend4:badend4_ED24E8C2_97DA_4BC6_A2E8_6FD2942EF79E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18d61b35c96e1119f12ac09bdf01bbbb61751ffbfe3e80e539270a05cc4fcd68
#. default-sha256: 84d3d331ad1ee5134ed71a25ebc959cde5dcf0fe38d82f3785a808da3dc171c7
msgctxt "badend4:badend4_ED24E8C2_97DA_4BC6_A2E8_6FD2942EF79E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I try to shout, but nothing comes out.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I can neither answer her original question..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Provo ad urlare, ma non esce alcun suono.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non posso né rispondere alla sua domanda "
"iniziale..."

#: badend4:badend4_E4AC1FC8_4D3A_4AC0_A5B4_BCB978B1B26F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
